[{"id":"1","type":"h1","meta":true,"children":[{"text":"9.1章节"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"收到 Gemini 报告。它与我此前设计的章节结构属于两种互补素材：原稿提供 wallet-review-lab 教学体系（可复现实验），Gemini 报告提供工业界案例与评测基准（外部视野）。下面先给融合说明，再开始逐节创作。"}],"id":"zuWWPKd1M5"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"pWxmg3eYCg"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"一、对 Gemini 报告的解读"}],"id":"hnjdKErW_a"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"hCg7rF","listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"结构","bold":true},{"text":"：开篇（ACR 范式转移背景）+ 9.1 工业落地（Meta RADAR / CodeRabbit / CodeAgent）+ 9.2 评测基准（SWR-Bench / ReviewBench / CodeScope）+ 9.3 零信任安全防御（仅开头，"},{"text":"在\"在这个风险光谱\"处被截断","bold":true},{"text":"）；"}],"id":"LjxZfixjBx"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"hCg7rF","listStart":2,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"数据特点","bold":true},{"text":"：包含大量第三方系统具体数字（如 Meta 的 105.9%、60.31%、1/50；CodeRabbit 的 91%、64%；CodeAgent 的 13.39%、31.6%；ReviewBench 的 92%、0.043 等）。按原稿自己的纪律（\"外部产品能力、漏洞状态和价格是否有一手来源与访问日期？\"），这些数字不能作为已验证事实直接写入图书，需在正文中标注来源性质，并在出版前以官方论文/工程博客逐一核验；"}],"id":"SPlLx9UOPJ"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"hCg7rF","listStart":3,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"与原稿的关系","bold":true},{"text":"：Gemini 报告没有覆盖原稿的 wallet-review-lab 案例体系、Finding Schema、仲裁、成本模型等内容。因此最终章节 = 原稿教学主线 + 报告业界参照，二者互补而非替代。"}],"id":"6wOC_eCMWp"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"二、融合映射与结构微调"}],"id":"g3tZRV-6rE"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"原 10 节结构微调为 "},{"text":"12 节","bold":true},{"text":"：新增 9.2（工业实践）与 9.11（安全防御），使 Gemini 报告内容有明确归属，同时保持原稿教学体系完整。"}],"id":"69oiOJUnUJ"},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"Gemini 报告内容","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"Eu_egsdH6C"}],"id":"2bqd5L-dJ-"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"融合位置","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"IXGoICMWy1"}],"id":"2s2fpFlYB7"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"融合方式","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"kydAGClI0E"}],"id":"napwV5k5-e"}],"id":"Ysg5Zp5TiY"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"开篇：范式转移、通知疲劳"}],"type":"p","id":"aa8fvQuDle"}],"id":"tN5SbQVJFG"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1.1"}],"type":"p","id":"bultRPnXHV"}],"id":"ftYC8aiWkK"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"作为困境背景"}],"type":"p","id":"zowr4WHXGw"}],"id":"J9UrC-zUkG"}],"id":"Zzj1i5rDiR"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1.1 Meta RADAR（DRS、P25/P50）"}],"type":"p","id":"xQVoFR8orB"}],"id":"DdJpWnxoYG"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.1（完整）＋9.12（生产落地借鉴）"}],"type":"p","id":"Bd39SRssje"}],"id":"9-M-VlihYX"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"工业案例独立展开"}],"type":"p","id":"Hlv_nkTKFQ"}],"id":"19-JqG6WF6"}],"id":"VDWXx88AKK"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1.2 CodeRabbit（AST 图谱、沙盒、五层管道）"}],"type":"p","id":"0y-wzXsZBv"}],"id":"O4IWRRHpOz"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.2（完整）＋9.6（流水线对照）"}],"type":"p","id":"I3qi5-DyZy"}],"id":"FvEzo8u7gI"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"同上"}],"type":"p","id":"nsJM_nupjO"}],"id":"l6L2QsPcQH"}],"id":"I4XBVLPyyE"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1.3 CodeAgent（提示词漂移、QA-Checker）"}],"type":"p","id":"p50Xv8AFcr"}],"id":"6w3ohziuq3"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.3（完整）＋9.5（多 Agent 对照）"}],"type":"p","id":"FjYG3zPOkH"}],"id":"Nic8oak0_l"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"同上"}],"type":"p","id":"QEahcbc-SU"}],"id":"bd2PiuO6q_"}],"id":"hA4taP-dxI"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.1 SWR-Bench"}],"type":"p","id":"TZzTs1aQkK"}],"id":"G3FfRRiqXP"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.9.4"}],"type":"p","id":"V_8AiGDUAA"}],"id":"P-fF8N1ASk"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"评测节\"外部基准\"部分"}],"type":"p","id":"p2n3lTsyJU"}],"id":"Q6xnd90eGT"}],"id":"SB1J1EdZFx"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.2 ReviewBench"}],"type":"p","id":"Q830b21zGa"}],"id":"dXT-OPSMbZ"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.9.4"}],"type":"p","id":"mAmfoaPByV"}],"id":"G1-Et4AAh-"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"同上"}],"type":"p","id":"RSrH6oyClp"}],"id":"QFR0a6BdmN"}],"id":"SJ9hum80BH"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.2.3 CodeScope"}],"type":"p","id":"GGL5FbFD0j"}],"id":"fNDAFcZEAw"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.9.4"}],"type":"p","id":"VqIXz8WyYW"}],"id":"uL0I3ovHSG"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"同上"}],"type":"p","id":"e7Jj7D8HWE"}],"id":"0yns2xVUry"}],"id":"Jh_wPfAUpR"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.3 零信任防御（OWASP Top 10）"}],"type":"p","id":"1J-tb75IaX"}],"id":"aGdlYrQOda"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.11（完整）＋9.7 PR-08（教学应用）"}],"type":"p","id":"BO_u7GdwPx"}],"id":"8GqDT-uv3u"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"独立成节"}],"type":"p","id":"QND15_womL"}],"id":"50yBaBHLZF"}],"id":"UeiIYocCUD"}],"id":"_M0VfwNFSa","colSizes":[284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667]},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"三、数据纪律（贯穿全章）"}],"id":"ouTtiV4e8h"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"第三方系统数据统一标注为\""},{"text":"据公开工程博客/研究论文转述，具体数字以官方一手来源为准，出版时需核验并标注访问日期","bold":true},{"text":"\"；"}],"id":"F51i-Uc2P-"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"原稿事实（wallet-review-lab 各项实验）与报告转述、作者推论三者用文字显式区分；"}],"id":"yvpAIKMyNU"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"录制回放边界、RLock 边界等原稿声明全部保留。"}],"id":"WvzNo6drMm"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"YTMvtf9tqP"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"四、正文创作：9.1 节（已完成）"}],"id":"vp_zVBF9Ww"},{"type":"h1","children":[{"text":"9.1 评审的困境与证据闭环"}],"id":"49CS8xDDCq"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.1 当瓶颈从\"写代码\"转向\"证明代码\""}],"id":"t-CKk70e7N"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"代码评审（Code Review）长期是现代软件工程保障质量与知识流转的关键环节。过去十年，它的成本结构是稳定的：人写代码，人审代码，速度大致匹配。大语言模型驱动的 AI 编程助手（如 GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等）大规模普及后，这个平衡被打破——开发者生成代码的速度呈指数级增长，而人类评审者的阅读与判断速度没有同步提升。供需失衡的直接后果是：评审队列积压、发布周期拉长、人类评审容量成为软件发布周期的核心瓶颈。"}],"id":"2GCEPTumJ7"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"自动化代码评审（Automated Code Review, ACR）正是在这个背景下经历范式转移：从静态代码扫描工具（Static Analysis Tools），到单体生成式语言模型，再到基于多 Agent 协同的架构。单体大模型做评审有两个结构性缺陷。其一是上下文窗口限制：复杂的工业级代码库无法整体载入，模型只能看到被截断的局部。其二是注意力衰减（attention decay）：在长上下文中，模型会逐渐遗忘早期出现的关键约束，产生与业务上下文脱节的\"幻觉\"（hallucination）评论。大量无关痛痒或虚假的警告淹没真实缺陷，工程团队称之为\"通知疲劳\"（Notification Fatigue）——评审系统输出得越多，开发者越倾向于忽略全部输出。"}],"id":"JuEETTrYzp"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"多 Agent 架构的回应是角色专业化分工：把抽象语法树（AST）分析、逻辑推理、安全渗透、多步验证等不同能力分配给不同角色，将复杂审查任务拆解为可控的智能工作流。但这里必须澄清一个容易混淆的前提："},{"text":"多 Agent 本身并不解决\"评论质量\"问题。","bold":true},{"text":" 如果每个 Agent 都只是用自然语言发表意见，系统只是把\"一条幻觉\"放大成\"多条幻觉\"。"}],"id":"ahxD-dN3tU"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"本章的核心命题因此是："}],"id":"N1HphNe2WD"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI 代码评审的工程价值不在于生成更多评论，而在于构建一条可验证、可回放、可审计、可问责的证据闭环。","bold":true}],"id":"wTLeGNp1sx"}],"id":"qWgvbIk04B"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"确定性工具产生事实，模型连接与解释事实，策略引擎执行不可绕过的规则，人类承担高风险取舍与最终责任。本章以 wallet-review-lab 数字钱包服务为主线实验场，并在各节对照工业界真实系统（Meta RADAR、CodeRabbit、CodeAgent）与评测基准（SWR-Bench、ReviewBench、CodeScope）讨论生产落地。wallet-review-lab 不连接真实资金，却保留了足以让评审变得严肃的四条业务不变量（见 9.3）。"}],"id":"KzTT9Ip8v2"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.2 测试通过不等于代码正确：PR-02 反例"}],"id":"tkmWDO3eAw"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"\"测试全绿，可以合并\"是许多团队默认的验收直觉。本章的第一个反例正来自这个直觉。"}],"id":"ZT-63vOTpb"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"PR-02 将金额转换为浮点数再归一化。常规示例中的 "},{"text":"10.00","code":true},{"text":"、"},{"text":"20.50","code":true},{"text":" 可能全部通过，但团队的货币策略要求金额使用十进制定点表示，禁止经过二进制浮点数往返。Semgrep 可以标出这一禁止模式，Agent 则负责解释它与账务风险的关系。"}],"id":"Kv2DCl37k3"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"这里存在三种不同性质的结论，如表 9-1 所示："}],"id":"hqkFHHUa4O"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"表 9-1 三种结论的性质边界","bold":true}],"id":"01-2JLuuHC"},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"结论","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"E62L3eYi14"}],"id":"D4bmY-4yqH"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"由谁产生","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"AbVl04qfBt"}],"id":"OGDnKTDDmJ"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"证明的范围","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"w7jORnL-Nt"}],"id":"VgRL6GnC1F"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"不能冒充什么","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"5jo2lA8Ycb"}],"id":"Cokpht-MLA"}],"id":"IdmPlst6Dk"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"测试证明"}],"type":"p","id":"YOXyP2HSy5"}],"id":"gZV9j6VJjz"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"确定性测试"}],"type":"p","id":"nBZP9R41dD"}],"id":"fjMZiV_Seg"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"已执行样例没有失败"}],"type":"p","id":"ksOJTjMhcI"}],"id":"j2KmXQgBwS"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"设计正确性"}],"type":"p","id":"00H_tQedg8"}],"id":"D_PdS27GX5"}],"id":"_1rWzG8cuq"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"规则证明"}],"type":"p","id":"h4QSeJqE5M"}],"id":"JIQal5TF05"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"静态分析/扫描器"}],"type":"p","id":"I_VPyBTwUY"}],"id":"KjmdvjBQVi"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"代码命中了团队禁止模式"}],"type":"p","id":"7WQw0zWB8-"}],"id":"NfUL4bswg7"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"事故后果"}],"type":"p","id":"O7QcxapYGn"}],"id":"kcG3r9TfHs"}],"id":"JORixtJdv0"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"Agent 解释"}],"type":"p","id":"m_QojSdmKe"}],"id":"Wa3YFJcN0X"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"大模型"}],"type":"p","id":"2FjcDiAnHM"}],"id":"KNinaUSGMq"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"规则为何适用、风险如何传导"}],"type":"p","id":"AVtkWHNaa6"}],"id":"l_OwiLkP7C"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"测试或规则本身"}],"type":"p","id":"O9a4dYcH-M"}],"id":"z7mAsG10bU"}],"id":"NRxnOUCG95"}],"id":"GhYUz9Xc7O","colSizes":[213.5,213.5,213.5,213.5]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"任何一项都不能冒充另外两项。若规则误配，Agent 应指出适用性问题，而不是因为扫描器亮红灯就编造事故后果。这个案例的完整评审在 9.7 展开，现在只需要记住一条原则："},{"text":"测试通过只能证明\"已执行样例未失败\"，不能证明\"设计正确\"。","bold":true},{"text":" 后者需要不变量、规则与人工确认共同支撑。"}],"id":"x3Elnwojup"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.3 确定性工具、模型解释与策略引擎的分工"}],"id":"JmDfRznmSk"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI 适合处理跨文件阅读、模式归纳和解释性工作：概括 PR 意图，列出受影响的 API 与状态，关联测试失败与源码位置，对照需求寻找边界条件，并把已确认的问题写成可执行的评审意见。它尤其适合把多种证据组织成一条人类易读的因果链。"}],"id":"f59CkcGbRZ"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI 不适合单独证明并发、账务或安全属性，也不应确认外部实时状态、自主改变门禁或批准资金和权限变更。两个贯穿全章的例证："}],"id":"sbtIV2ZfqF"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"PR-04（并发双花）","bold":true},{"text":"：Agent 可以指出\"余额检查与更新不在同一原子边界\"，却不能凭置信度替代并发测试。真正证明竞态存在的，是可重复的并发测试与清晰的不变量；"}],"id":"OpsejwewqB"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"PR-03（对象级授权）","bold":true},{"text":"：Agent 可以解释\"登录成功不等于拥有这个钱包\"，但授权回归测试才是阻断证据。"}],"id":"pMNmeLxVzz"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"由此得到本章最基本的四层分工："}],"id":"iW14IIBawy"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"_Dn162","listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"确定性工具","bold":true},{"text":"（测试、静态分析、扫描器、锁文件解析）产生事实；"}],"id":"48y1KeeNsN"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"_Dn162","listStart":2,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"Agent","bold":true},{"text":" 解释并连接事实；"}],"id":"YskJuosrhs"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"_Dn162","listStart":3,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"策略引擎","bold":true},{"text":"（风险路由、门禁）执行不可绕过的规则；"}],"id":"4OJ0orwn41"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"_Dn162","listStart":4,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"人类","bold":true},{"text":"承担高风险取舍与最终责任。"}],"id":"7LUhhA_Atq"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"所谓\"AI 适合做什么\"，因此不是模型能力的抽象排名，而是任务是否具有可观察输入、可复现结果与明确的升级边界。"}],"id":"tSsRTeVc4j"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.4 四种不确定性必须分开处理"}],"id":"L66QOu4AwL"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"工程上最危险的错误，是把所有\"不确定\"混为一谈，再用模型的自信语气统一覆盖。至少四种不确定性需要分开处理："}],"id":"GZK86bQcRQ"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"3xvx0D","listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"来自代码本身的不确定性","bold":true},{"text":"：并发、异常回滚、事务隔离通常需要运行测试或查看数据库语义，单凭 Diff 只能提出假设；"}],"id":"DHHkc5A7eQ"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"3xvx0D","listStart":2,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"来自外部事实的不确定性","bold":true},{"text":"：依赖是否存在漏洞、某个 API 当前是否支持某参数，需要锁文件与官方文档等一手来源，不能靠模型记忆；"}],"id":"2ecDoYLTn0"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"3xvx0D","listStart":3,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"来自模型自身的不确定性","bold":true},{"text":"：幻觉与置信度漂移，只能通过证据约束与评测暴露；"}],"id":"NgD0HiKoQJ"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"3xvx0D","listStart":4,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"来自责任归属的不确定性","bold":true},{"text":"：批准变更、确认实时状态属于责任动作，不能因为模型置信度高就自动执行。"}],"id":"gig-s5y_zl"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"四种不确定性对应四种不同的取证手段，混用其中任何一种，都会把推断误写成事实。"}],"id":"cyU58Lj6nv"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.5 为什么自然语言、置信度与投票不能代替证据"}],"id":"fh9yX7Efy7"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"三句\"听起来合理\"的说法，在本章都会被否定："}],"id":"-88ZZ21bE7"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"\"Agent 之间用自然语言传递意见就够了。\"","bold":true},{"text":" 不够。自然语言没有结构、无法校验，也区分不了\"事实\"与\"推测\"。若上游 Agent 产生幻觉，下游 Agent 会把这句话当作事实继续传播，形成错误级联。多 Agent 之间必须使用结构化 Finding 与工具证据作为通信协议（见 9.5、9.6）；"}],"id":"LlPZG9U-xP"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"\"置信度高就能阻断。\"","bold":true},{"text":" 不能。置信度只能用于排序，不能替代证据。Finding Schema 中的 "},{"text":"confidence","code":true},{"text":" 字段的作用是排序候选，而不是批准依据；"}],"id":"sU90IgT9yc"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"\"多数 Agent 投票就能定论。\"","bold":true},{"text":" 不能。若一个 Agent 持有可重现的并发失败，而另外三个 Agent 只是\"未发现问题\"，多数票不能抵消失败测试——\"未发现\"不是反证。"}],"id":"SueIFIjmqN"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"9.1.6 本章阅读地图"}],"id":"tZ6uMCu_Ne"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"本章主线是一条可复用的证据闭环，对应图 9-1："}],"id":"9uOtr_Cf4a"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"需求与不变量 → 确定性工具 → 独立证据 → 专业 Agent 解释 → 根因仲裁 → 人工责任 → 策略门禁 → 可复现评测 → 持续改进。","bold":true}],"id":"NEcG51G6js"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"<code>flowchart LR"}],"type":"code_line","id":"JpZd6hk3y0"},{"children":[{"text":"  A[\"需求与不变量\"] --> B[\"确定性工具<br/>测试 / 静态分析 / 扫描器 / 锁文件\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"mMnn331OJ8"},{"children":[{"text":"  B --> C[\"独立证据<br/>结构化 Finding\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"izWkzrPg0p"},{"children":[{"text":"  C --> D[\"专业 Agent 解释<br/>correctness / test / security / impact\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"6TuHhGi8Nn"},{"children":[{"text":"  D --> E[\"根因仲裁<br/>去重 / 冲突处理\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"8NmwODgkaF"},{"children":[{"text":"  E --> F[\"人工责任<br/>Tech Lead 终审 / 裁决记录\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"8JOTQufSiN"},{"children":[{"text":"  F --> G[\"策略门禁<br/>不可绕过\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"zDcOSU2Lbs"},{"children":[{"text":"  G --> H[\"可复现评测<br/>Oracle / Precision / Recall\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"FB2A_MEr8z"},{"children":[{"text":"  H --> I[\"持续改进<br/>影子模式 → 有限门禁\"]"}],"type":"code_line","id":"HrhLqkGBE-"},{"children":[{"text":"  I --> A"}],"type":"code_line","id":"owRL6fo6By"},{"children":[{"text":"</code>"}],"type":"code_line","id":"iiu6JUXIV-"}],"type":"code_block","lang":"mermaid","id":"Z5PAOIlC1F"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"图 9-1 证据闭环逻辑链。","bold":true},{"text":" 图中每个环节都必须在下一环节开始前留下可复核产物：工具留下测试日志与扫描结果，Agent 留下带证据引用的结构化 Finding，仲裁留下合并记录，人工留下裁决记录。任何环节缺失，闭环即断裂，系统退化为\"把自然语言搬进 CI\"。"}],"id":"QpBb_QeKjI"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"全章章节安排：9.2 对照工业界落地架构；9.3 建立 wallet-review-lab 实验场；9.4–9.6 完成单 Agent 到多 Agent 到证据流水线；9.7 深度实战六类缺陷；9.8 仲裁与治理；9.9 评测（Oracle 矩阵与行业基准）；9.10 成本与路由；9.11 安全防御；9.12 端到端演练。"}],"id":"KsmoPba7d_"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"本节小结","bold":true},{"text":"：评审的困境不是\"模型评论不够多\"，而是\"评论无法被验证\"。本章所有机制——不变量、Oracle、任务契约、Schema、证据包、仲裁、门禁、评测——都是为同一个目标服务：把模型的每一次判断都变成可复核的工程事实。"}],"id":"qfIXsQlt9I"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.1 练习","bold":true}],"id":"WP6owjq88x"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"70l93W","listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"回顾你团队最近一次\"测试全绿但线上出错\"的变更，指出被测试遗漏的业务不变量；"}],"id":"BBeCqRpxHk"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"70l93W","listStart":2,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"把一次真实评审意见拆成\"事实 / 解释 / 决策\"三列，检查哪一列缺少证据支撑；"}],"id":"VZNXo7anhc"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"70l93W","listStart":3,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"讨论：如果评审 Agent 只输出自然语言评论，你的 CI 门禁能否判断它是否应该阻断合并？"}],"id":"KPPMXEMm5G"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"2HZcOc6___"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"五、进度记录与后续计划"}],"id":"KzNsnl78l5"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"已完成","bold":true},{"text":"：9.1（本回复）。"},{"text":"待完成","bold":true},{"text":"：9.2–9.12。"}],"id":"m8xfO4Upn5"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"后续各节创作前的核验计划："}],"id":"xRE3OKSb9i"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.2（Meta RADAR / CodeRabbit / CodeAgent）：创作前联网核验三个系统的官方来源（Meta 工程博客、CodeRabbit 技术文档、CodeAgent 论文），并把 Gemini 报告中的数字标注为\"报告转述，以官方来源为准\"；"}],"id":"qTqlOs5n7y"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.9（SWR-Bench / ReviewBench / CodeScope）：创作前核验论文与项目主页，标注数据出处；"}],"id":"TxKyti_fv6"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.11（零信任防御 / OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications）：核验 OWASP 版本与发布时间。"}],"id":"MN-Zu6r1fd"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"请您确认/补全三件事","bold":true},{"text":"："}],"id":"wqXu5RyHkW"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"YOASeq","listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"Gemini 报告 9.3 在\"在这个风险光谱\"处截断，请补全剩余内容（或授权我按零信任主题续写）；"}],"id":"gGRTjo3fwL"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"YOASeq","listStart":2,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.1.4\"四种不确定性\"中，原稿原句在\"官方公……\"处截断，我按完整逻辑续写了第二类，请核对与您手中原文是否一致；"}],"id":"VBeFhm0qJX"},{"indent":1,"listGroup":"YOASeq","listStart":3,"listStyleType":"decimal","type":"p","children":[{"text":"确认 12 节结构与上述融合映射是否符合预期，确认后我继续创作 9.2。"}],"id":"eLGXg8F6Lt"}]